string-array.item:
You can:


1. Send me an email through the feedback button in the upper-right corner of Help or About, when you run into a problem not mentioned here or have new suggestions or ideas;


2. Go to Coolapk and comment on EverythingDone's page, when you also want to hear what other people think about your questions or suggestions;


3. Leave a message while donating to me, when you really like this app and want to thank me ^_^.

Currently (version 1.3.8), EverythingDone needs these permissions:


1. Start after boot, used to set reminders. If you do not grant EverythingDone this permission, it will not be able to continue reminding you of schedules, habits, or goals after you restart your phone;


2. Read and write storage, used to insert attachments, save screenshots when sharing usage, and so on;


3. Record audio, used to record audio files as thing attachments;


4. Vibrate, used to notify you more effectively when finishing things;


5. Fingerprint permission is needed on Android 6.0 and above, used to unlock private things with your fingerprint;


6. Keep the device awake, used to keep the countdown accurate after you start doing something.


Your phone's permission manager or optimisation app may also say that EverythingDone needs permission to start in the background. This is also used to keep reminders working normally.


I promise: I will never request unrelated permissions, and I will never use granted permissions to do wrong things.

resources.string:
If you are using some apps that can improve your Android system, or there are such kind of pre-installed apps in your phone, please add EverythingDone to their white-list, otherwise maybe you cannot receive notifications from EverythingDone.

In addition, please grant permissions that EverythingDone requested in permission manager. These permissions are:
(1) Auto boot after phone boots, used to create notifications for Reminder,Habit and Goals;
(2) Read/Write external storage, used to insert file as attachment for things;
(3) Record audio, used to record audio as attachment for things;
(4) Vibrate, help generate better notifications for you to finish things.
EverythingDone promises that it won't use these permissions to do bad things. Thank you.
